      "message": "I installed the Tethering mainline module that contains this CL to the Android TV device on U branch. This CL works. The Tethering mainline module can read out the configured country code via the system property. \n\nHere are test logs for your reference.\n\n```\ntv:/ # getprop ro.build.version.sdk\n34\ntv:/ # getprop ro.boot.threadnetwork.country_code\nCN\ntv:/ # dumpsys thread_network\n---- Dump of ThreadNetworkCountryCode begin ----\nmOverrideCountryCodeInfo        : null\nmTelephonyCountryCodeSlotInfoMap: {}\nmTelephonyCountryCodeInfo       : null\nmWifiCountryCodeInfo            : CountryCodeInfo{ mCountryCode: US, mSource: Wifi, mUpdatedTimestamp: 2024-01-03T19:56:42.714281Z}\nmTelephonyLastCountryCodeInfo   : null\nmLocationCountryCodeInfo        : null\nmOemCountryCodeInfo             : CountryCodeInfo{ mCountryCode: CN, mSource: Oem, mUpdatedTimestamp: 2024-01-03T19:56:42.519834Z}\nmCurrentCountryCodeInfo         : null\n---- Dump of ThreadNetworkCountryCode end ------\n```",
